          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Records from India. LAKSHADWEEP: Kavaratti — Rao (1991); GENERAL RECORD: Naidu & Rao (2004). Habitat. Marine, intertidal; coarse and medium coralline sand, 10 cm below surface between low and mid water levels.",
